  description: Use when the user asks about scheduling conflicts, double-booked or overlapping meetings, back-to-back meetings with no buffer, or wants help rescheduling a meeting to avoid a clash. Do NOT use for a simple request to move a single meeting to a specific, already-known new time with no conflict involved.
